msgid "Scenario I: One Night Only"
msgstr ""

msgid "The woods south of Uptown loom above you in the fading light as you approach the circus grounds. Smiling barkers take your tickets and usher you in with enthusiastic shouts of the many waiting attractions, though you only take note of potential threats. If this circus is harboring dark and deadly things, then you can't afford to let your guard down for even a moment. You follow the flow of the crowd to the main tent, wondering just where trouble might start."
msgstr ""

